	keywords = {Antennas; Budget control; Decision making; Drones; Environmental management; Environmental regulations; Environmental technology; Image enhancement; Open pit mining; Public administration; Remote sensing; Restoration; Vegetation; Detection and quantifications; Environmental liabilities; Land cover classification; Mine restorations; Multi-spectral imagery; Structural information; UAV remote sensing; Unmanned aerial systems; land reclamation; monitoring; multispectral image; opencast mining; remote sensing; satellite imagery; unmanned vehicle; Article; controlled study; documentation; dumping; ecosystem monitoring; ecosystem restoration; geographic information system; grassland; ground truth plots; k nearest neighbor; land use; measurement; mining; nonhuman; opencast mining; optical sensor; photogrammetry; plant development; plots and curves; priority journal; remote sensing; scrub; software; soil; Spain; spectroradiometer; topsoiol; unmanned aerial system; vegetation; Image reconstruction},
